<%- include('partials/header') %>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F172A 0%, #1E293B 100%);
    padding: 70px 0;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .page-hero { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #020617 0%, #0F172A 100%); }
  .page-hero-icon {
    width: 70px; height: 70px; border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(0,229,160,0.15);
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.8rem; color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 18px; position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }
  .page-hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }
  
  .page-content { padding: 56px 0; background: var(--bg-body); }
  .content-wrapper { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
  
  .policy-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: clamp(20px, 4vw, 32px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  .policy-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
  .policy-card h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.3rem);
    font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  }
  .policy-card h2 i { color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .policy-card p { color: var(--text-body); font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .policy-card ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .policy-card ul li {
    padding: 8px 0; color: var(--text-body); font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;
  }
  .policy-card ul li i { color: var(--success); margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  
  .warning-box {
    background: var(--warning-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--warning);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .warning-box p {
    color: #92400E; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .page-hero { padding: 48px 0; }
    .page-hero-icon { width: 50px; height: 50px; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .page-content { padding: 36px 0; }
    .policy-card { padding: 20px; }
    .policy-card p { font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .policy-card ul li { font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .warning-box { padding: 14px 16px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-icon"><i class="fas fa-undo-alt"></i></div>
  <h1 class="page-hero-title">Returns & Exchanges</h1>
</div>

<div class="page-content">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content-wrapper">
      
      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2><i class="fas fa-clock"></i> 48-Hour Reporting Window</h2>
        <p>If you receive a damaged product, wrong item, or have any complaint about your order, you must report it <strong>within 48 hours (2 days)</strong> of receiving your order.</p>
        <div class="warning-box">
          <p><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i> Reports made after 48 hours of delivery cannot be accepted.</p>
        </div>
        <p>This reporting window ensures we can quickly address any issues with our fulfillment partners and resolve your concern promptly.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2><i class="fas fa-list-check"></i> How to Report an Issue</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Contact us immediately via email or WhatsApp</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Provide your Order Number and photos of the issue</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Our team will review and respond within 24-48 hours</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Resolutions may include replacement, refund, or credit</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2><i class="fas fa-box-open"></i> What Can Be Reported</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Damaged or broken product on arrival</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Wrong item received (different from what was ordered)</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Missing items from the order</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Product not functioning as described</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i> Resolution Process</h2>
        <p>All complaints are handled by our fulfillment partners who pack and ship your orders. ShopNest acts as your advocate to ensure the issue is resolved fairly. Resolution options include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Full or partial refund</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Product replacement</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2><i class="fas fa-phone"></i> Contact for Complaints</h2>
        <p>Email: <strong>shopnest.management@gmail.com</strong></p>
        <p>WhatsApp: <strong>+94 72 128 9555</strong></p>
        <p>Response within 24-48 hours.</p>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>